{"content":[{"c":["SHEBA (P",{"c":["erson"],"sourceClass":"lc","t":"span"},")"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Son of Raamah, the brother of Dedan and a descendant of Noah through Ham’s line (",{"href":"?bref=Gen.10.7","r":"Gen.10.7","rawR":"Gen.10.7","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.10.7","value":"Gen.10.7"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gn 10:7"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.1.9","r":"1Chr.1.9","rawR":"1Chr.1.9","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.1.9","value":"1Chr.1.9"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 1:9"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. One of the 13 sons of Joktan and a descendant of Noah through Shem’s line (",{"href":"?bref=Gen.10.28","r":"Gen.10.28","rawR":"Gen.10.28","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.10.28","value":"Gen.10.28"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gn 10:28"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.1.22","r":"1Chr.1.22","rawR":"1Chr.1.22","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.1.22","value":"1Chr.1.22"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 1:22"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["3. Son of Jokshan, the brother of Dedan and the grandson of Abraham and Keturah (",{"href":"?bref=Gen.25.3","r":"Gen.25.3","rawR":"Gen.25.3","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.25.3","value":"Gen.25.3"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gn 25:3"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.1.32","r":"1Chr.1.32","rawR":"1Chr.1.32","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.1.32","value":"1Chr.1.32"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 1:32"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["4. Benjaminite and the son of Bicri. After the death of Absalom, Sheba incited Israel to rebel against David. Under the command of Joab, the revolt was subdued and Sheba was beheaded at Abel-beth-maacah (",{"href":"?bref=2Sam.20.1-22","r":"2Sam.20.1-22","rawR":"2Sam.20.1-22","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Sam.20.1-22","value":"2Sam.20.1-22"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Sm 20:1-22"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["5. One of the Gadite leaders ruling in Bashan, registered during the reigns of Jotham king of Judah (750–732 ",{"c":["BC"],"sourceClass":"era","t":"span"},") and Jeroboam II king of Israel (793–753 ",{"c":["BC"],"sourceClass":"era","t":"span"},"); ",{"c":["see"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.5.13,16-17","r":"1Chr.5.13,16-17","rawR":"1Chr.5.13,16-17","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.5.13,16-17","value":"1Chr.5.13,16-17"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 5:13, 16-17"},"."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"ShebaPerson","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Gn 10:7","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Gen.10.7","rawQueryValue":"Gen.10.7","sourceRefExact":"Gen.10.7"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 1:9","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.1.9","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.1.9","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.1.9"},{"anchorText":"Gn 10:28","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Gen.10.28","rawQueryValue":"Gen.10.28","sourceRefExact":"Gen.10.28"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 1:22","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.1.22","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.1.22","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.1.22"},{"anchorText":"Gn 25:3","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Gen.25.3","rawQueryValue":"Gen.25.3","sourceRefExact":"Gen.25.3"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 1:32","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.1.32","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.1.32","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.1.32"},{"anchorText":"2 Sm 20:1-22","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Sam.20.1-22","rawQueryValue":"2Sam.20.1-22","sourceRefExact":"2Sam.20.1-22"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 5:13, 16-17","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.5.13,16-17","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.5.13,16-17","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.5.13,16-17"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"312471a9d2cf9fbf824f7db1669a9a63b6ff702370178d555ddd720f4e6